WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.500
I was going to celebrate Christmas with Aoyama-kun.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.610
I was waiting for him under the Christmas tree.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.690
But...

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>Ooh, you’re early, kitty!</i>

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.150
<i>I’ll definitely protect them!</i>

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.580
<i>I’m NOT working to be praised!</i>

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.990
<i>Oh? That’s a Mew Aqua, no doubt!</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.140
Quiche! I definitely won’t let you have the Mew Aqua!

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.600
I see. But it’s not good
to monopolize it.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.380
A Mew Aqua is not something that lower
creatures like humans can handle.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.100
Pearls before swine!

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.150
Let’s go!

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.940
What are you going to do?

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.360
Mew Pudding, protect it!

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.230
Shirogane!

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.970
Ok, I got it! Mew Mint!

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:16.300
Reborn PuddingRings INFERNO!

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:19.260
Fu Shi Sen!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.970
I might have made it, I might not have made it.

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:31.850
Our trick worked.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.520
How kind of you...

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:40.200
to help us extinguish humankind.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.730
What?

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.270
What do you mean?

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:44.660
<i>We are in trouble.</i>

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:48.240
They are trying to enhance the power of the Mew Aqua!

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.700
The Mew Aqua, wrapped up with PuddingRings Inferno

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.840
...is in a state of excitation.

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:57.590
It will reach the critical point
all by itself!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.960
So they’re using PuddingRings Inferno as a detonator!?

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.040
Exactly.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:06.850
The Mew Aqua reacts with the
energy from the PuddingRings.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.920
They’ve also added additional
energy to it.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.970
The explosion will be massive.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:16.270
The estimated blast radius is...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.220
160 km.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.950
The whole Kanto region would be destroyed!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.560
Terrible!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.690
It’s my fault that something terrible will happen!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.900
Mew Pudding, can’t you
make it disappear?

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.280
No, I only create it,
I don’t know how to destroy it.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:37.210
I can only wait till it fades
away naturally.

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.700
Shirogane, what can we do?

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:44.000
The PuddingRings won’t
disappear in time.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:44.640
Damn.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.140
What on earth should we do...?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.390
Now, how much time is left, I wonder?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.970
Stop it, Quiche!

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.690
Humans are the ones to blame.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.070
This used to be our planet.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.780
For thousands of years,

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:14.490
we’ve dreamed of returning to this jewel of a planet with its beautiful water and plants.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:21.880
That hope has sustained us despite
our terrible living conditions.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.470
Our species are living on a planet
with harsh conditions even now!

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.760
This polluted place is not our “promised planet”!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.760
Everybody, watch out! Watch out!

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:41.680
Oh no.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.370
The Mew Aqua is reaching the critical point!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.530
Ichigo, I’ll keep repeating this until you get it.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.830
This is our planet.

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:53.780
In our eyes, you are the aliens!

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.910
So what?

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:57.960
What!?

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.330
Don’t be selfish!

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:06.220
My mother and father were killed by your
comrades, the Chimera Animas!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.170
Just as you love your families on your planet,

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:13.190
we have our own friends and our own families.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.130
Alien or human,

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.820
who wants to lose someone he loves?

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:20.980
That’s why we fight!

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.020
To protect our beloved ones!

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.770
That’s what Tokyo Mew Mew is here for!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:27.530
Shirogane...

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.240
Enough melodramatic speeches.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.650
Oneesama?

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:33.570
Let’s settle the matter.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:34.290
Come with me!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:40.030
Anyway, let’s destroy the PuddingRings
before the Mew Aqua explodes!

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:40.710
Ok.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.260
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.180
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.600
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.690
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.600
We can’t let you do that!

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.190
That won’t work!

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.120
Just come, we’ll kick you back.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.580
Let’s attack again!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.910
You underestimate us.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.380
We’re trapped!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:22.050
We don’t have time for this!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.910
We’re not going to make it!

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.340
Don’t give up!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:30.760
Ichigo! If this knocks you out, I’ll take
you with me, but not the others!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.880
Take this!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.640
No! I can’t dodge it!

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.530
The Blue Knight!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:46.480
Shirogane...?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.450
Damn you!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.950
Quiche!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.030
Damn it...

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:04.950
Don’t go!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:08.050
It’s going to reach the critical
point soon. You’d be hurt too!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.620
Blue Knight!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.430
Hurry up!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.890
If you combine your powers, you
should be able to make it!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.130
He’s right.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:18.850
Let’s hurry.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:23.820
There’s no other way but to combine
our power to stop the explosion.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:26.260
We have to be determined.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.320
There’s no other way. All or nothing!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.280
Everyone, lend me your powers please!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:50.880
Now, go!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.800
We made it!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:00.940
Not yet.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.970
Let’s go!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.600
Mew Power Extension!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.070
What energy...

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.070
Just a little bit to go...

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.030
...to go!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.380
...to go!?

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:36.260
Aoyama-kun!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.740
Aoyama-kun! Aoyama-kun!

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:54.480
What we did wasn’t perfect,

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.700
but we greatly reduced the explosive power.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.190
That’s great!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.520
Where’s Mew Strawberry?

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.210
Ah, over there!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.490
Aoyama-kun!

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:05.830
Hang in there!

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.410
Aoyama-kun...

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.540
Hey, Quiche!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.120
Wake up!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.600
That’s a pretty deep wound.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.550
We should treat him as soon as possible, or he might die.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.640
Really...?

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.380
That won’t be necessary.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.570
But... Deep Blue-sama,
at this rate, he will...!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.890
Although it’s only a little,

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:36.980
the Mew Aqua power has poured across
the dimensions and into my body.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:41.580
I feel I have been filled with great power;
even stronger than I had before.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.740
I no longer require his assistance.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:49.250
I shall leave the rest to you two.
Collect all the Mew Aqua.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.790
Are you saying you’re going
to let him die!?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:55.550
Sure, he’s annoying sometimes,
but you’re going too far!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.510
My awakening shall be given priority over everything else.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.080
No fair!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.210
Tart!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.210
Don’t defy Deep Blue-sama!

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:04.980
But...

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:12.890
Because of this,

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:17.400
because of the Mew Aqua, Aoyama-kun got...

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:21.350
Let go of me!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.060
Calm down already!

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.190
I can’t!

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:26.750
Aoyama-kun is... Aoyama-kun is...

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.950
Calm down, Momomiya Ichigo!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.410
Mew Strawberry isn’t the one who should go help Aoyama;

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:33.710
Momomiya Ichigo is the one, right?

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.540
The ambulance is on its way.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.580
Hurry and change back to your normal
form so you can go with him.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.710
Shirogane...

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.640
The others should hurry and collect the Mew Aqua.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.840
Some of them have scattered.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.220
But, what about Ichigo-san and Aoyama-san?

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.140
He only needs Ichigo right now.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:53.860
Let’s go.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:55.440
Hurry up.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:00.240
Ok, calm down, Ichigo, calm down.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.030
Anyway, I need to change back.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:09.750
Ichigo!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.250
It’s dangero...

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.910
He’s recognized me!

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.880
This time, I’m sure!

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:58.840
<i>The meaning of “tears” is...
up to the lovers who own this.</i>

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.300
<i>But if the feeling of love is true,</i>

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.760
<i>it will be changed into a shining tear.</i>

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.260
Dear Lord, please save Aoyama-kun.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.670
I mean it.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:14.050
If only he gets better,
I don’t need “shining tears”.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:15.430
So, please...!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:20.810
The surgery is finished.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.390
How is Aoyama-kun?

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.980
Well, as for the wounds,
there are only bruises,

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:28.110
but he’s still unconscious
due to shock.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.950
I hope this is just temporary, but if
he doesn’t regain consciousness...

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:37.290
Anyway, in order to help him gain consciousness, please keep talking to him.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.550
This is Minto.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.390
I’ve finished collecting around Hinode Pier.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.270
This is Retasu.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.560
I’ve finished searching Harumi.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.600
Bu-Ling here.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.480
I’m done with Ginza.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:10.110
Thanks everyone, for your hard work.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:12.900
How’s it going?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.320
It’s going well.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.790
Although there still seem to be some left in Odaiba,

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:20.660
we’ve collected almost all the
ones scattered further away.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:21.830
This is Zakuro.

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:23.420
I am done with the Shinagawa area.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.330
Thank you.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.510
That guy... how is Aoyama-kun doing?

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.720
Ichigo called us,

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.260
saying his condition is unstable and he’s still in danger.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.890
I suppose... he’ll be ok.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:43.070
As they say, miracles happen in the Holy Night.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.460
Aoyama-kun?

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.550
Can you hear me?

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:13.170
I’ve always been lying to you...

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.970
not telling you that I’m a Mew Mew,

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:21.480
that my cat ears and tail pop out when I’m excited...

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.400
No matter what, I couldn’t tell you. I’m so sorry.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.190
I’ve tried... many, many times,

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.030
but I didn’t do if in the end.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:33.870
Because...

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:38.280
you told me that you loved me...

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:42.660
<i>I’ve been waiting for you all this time.</i>

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.510
<i>I love you.</i>

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:50.540
That must have been a dream,

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.720
that you told me you loved me...

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:58.730
I’ve always thought: “Please, don’t let me wake up!”

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:03.140
But a dream has to end.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:07.770
But... it’s ok.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:11.480
Anyway, the only thing I hope now is that you wake up!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.660
And then, after that...

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:19.620
We’ll return to the way it was before.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:24.910
I’ll watch you from far away,
with my friends...

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:26.710
So...

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.000
So...

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:32.420
Please...

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.600
I beg you, please, open your eyes!

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:45.770
Oh please,

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:47.650
Aoyama-kun.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.600
It’s starting snowing...

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:32.020
No wonder it’s so cold.

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:36.540
Let’s hurry and go visit Aoyama-oniichan
and Ichigo-oneechan!

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.040
Snow...?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.380
Thank you, O Lord!

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:13.530
Wait, Ichigo.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.040
Let’s go out, Ichigo.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:52.310
Snow in Tokyo on Christmas Eve.
What a surprise!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:54.400
Aoyama-kun.

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.020
I am, well...

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:57.980
I know.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.370
Actually, I noticed that you were
Mew Strawberry a long time ago.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.170
<i>What on earth are you?</i>

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:21.670
<i>Uhm, somehow... I’ve come to be really late...</i>

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:27.720
<i>I’ve been waiting for you all this time.</i>

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.730
Since I first met you,

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.900
and while waiting for you that day, I realized.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.720
To be honest, I was uneasy myself,

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:48.280
scared that our relationship might be ruined if I mentioned it.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:52.090
Besides, I have some secrets too.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:57.340
My earliest memories are
of an orphanage.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:00.220
So I don’t know who my
real parents are.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.970
My new family was looking for an intelligent child.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:08.020
They liked me and adopted
me as their son.

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:13.560
I decided to keep being a “good boy”.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.190
I’ve always met their expectations.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.650
I’ve always done everything perfectly.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:22.110
Everything I did, I did to survive.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.450
I was always surrounded by people. They relied on me.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.080
But nothing really captured
my interest.

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.480
They smiled at me as if they were my friends,

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:36.670
but really they found it useful to know me.
I was cynical enough to see that.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.590
But, Ichigo, you were different.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.920
You’re bright; You’re a crybaby.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.260
Like a charm, I felt so relaxed just being with you.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.890
When I was with you,
I could truly laugh.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:18:59.930
I love you.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.520
But... I’m a Mew Mew.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.770
Whenever my heart beats faster I grow cat ears.

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:10.620
I even turn into a cat!

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:13.930
If that happens,
I’ll hide them like this.

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:16.870
Then nobody will see them;
Nobody will find out.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:22.090
In return I want you to make me laugh when I’m unhappy.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:24.420
That’s... really ok?

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.130
If you are always with me...

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:32.520
Let this be a secret just between the two of us.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.650
This is called “Tears for Christmas”.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:50.820
It’s my Christmas present to you.

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:54.570
They say it will shine... if you have love...

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:57.000
They say even your tears will shine...!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.880
Ichigo, thank you.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.510
So I can be here with you...?

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.390
I can be with you,
Aoyama kun, forever...?

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:15.510
So it’s true...

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:18.110
in the Holy Night, miracles can happen.

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:28.250
Ahh, is this ok? Everything is going too well!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.900
Aoyama is so kind, I’m nearly scared!

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:35.320
I’m happy; so happy;
I feel as though I’m flying in the sky!

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:38.170
You must be seeing a dream.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:38.780
A dream?

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:41.750
Oh really... This is like a dream!

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:44.960
Next: “The Stolen Dream:
Sweet Trap in Lavender”

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:48.670
Ok, let me wake you up by pinching you as hard as I can!

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:54.220
Even that pain is comfortable.
I’m so crazy now...
